Fixed bugs in parsing of the fitswcs_imaging transform:
- crval/crpix/cdelt/pc array data was not read properly if their arrays were
  in compressed blocks, or not host endianness, etc.
- Structurally invalid data in certain cases (e.g. wrong array dimensionality)
  warned about in the logs, but did not return an error status, resulting in
  misleading deserialization success.
